{"title":"올 타임 하이","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=co9Mil/dJMcagN4jVf/Vj3MREIlqil3aEeNREbcY0&filename=th3","synopsis":"코인 사기로 날린 7천만 원. 남은 건 한강 다리 위에서의 미련과 단돈 500만 원뿐.\n죽으려다 마음 고쳐먹고 들어온 주식 판에서, 신희수는 제 인생을 설계하려는 남자 ‘에어라인’을 만난다.\n\n“야, 똥개. 가서 저 사기꾼 강의 듣고 보고해. 넌 돈이 급하고, 난 복수가 급하거든.”\n\n시골 똥개 취급하며 굴릴 땐 언제고, 차트 분석할 때만은 눈이 번뜩이는 희수에게 에어라인의 심장이 먼저 상한가를 치기 시작한다.\n주가 흐름은 읽어도 제 마음은 읽지 못하는, 두 ‘돈미새’들의 처절하고도 달콤한 풀베팅 로맨스!\n\n#주식물 #돈미새공수 #잘생쁨공 #예민공 #입덕부정공 #귀염수 #싹싹수 #자학개그수 #눈치없수","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":283,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":42,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":270,"change":{"type":"down","amount":228}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":26,"change":{"type":"up","amount":244}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":247,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":249,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":114,"change":{"type":"up","amount":135}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":107,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":99,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":64,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":85,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":90,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":105,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":125,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":141,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":36,"change":{"type":"up","amount":105}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":28,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":28,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":26,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":26,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":26,"change":{